# Prisma: schema in kit, migrations in RishiVerse

## In this kit (local)

- Edit `.prisma` models under `prisma/models/` and `prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Read-only: `npx prisma validate`, `npx prisma format`, `npx prisma generate`.
- For **local** throwaway DB only, `npx prisma db push` is allowed so the demo runs.

## In RishiVerse (production / shared)

Maintainers run:

- `prisma migrate dev` / `migrate deploy`
- seeds and DB resets

Do **not** expect your kit `db push` history to ship to production. Hand off schema files; maintainers create migrations.
